---
// Required by Astro's i18n routing (`redirectToDefaultLocale`) — without a
// root index page the build fails. In production, the `force` redirects in
// netlify.toml shadow this page with an instant, language-sniffed 302.
// This meta-refresh page only remains as the fallback (e.g. local preview).
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/en/">
    <link rel="canonical" href="/en/">
  </head>
  <body>
    <a href="/en/">ALEC</a>
  </body>
</html>
